From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 15:57:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/44] loader: open the MoE heat map in --host-experts mmap
 mode (LLAMA_MMAP_HEAT_OPEN=0: off)

The mmap mode returned from plan_host_expert_placement before the heat-map open, the only call site, so
the persisted heat map was never loaded or saved with --host-experts mmap (last write by a run on Flash-Next:
2026-11-08, the r235 layout).  Open it on every GPU device before that return; tables adopt the prior at
registration and the session tallies are saved on the debounce and at exit.

(cherry picked from commit c70ca4dde91e84b554e37b6df3045f04467dcb2e)
---
 src/llama-model-loader.cpp | 15 +++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 15 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/llama-model-loader.cpp b/src/llama-model-loader.cpp
index 339ac9e92..46520c26f 100644
--- a/src/llama-model-loader.cpp
+++ b/src/llama-model-loader.cpp
@@ -194,7 +194,22 @@ bool llama_model_loader::host_expert_selected(const std::string & name, int laye
 
 void llama_model_loader::plan_host_expert_placement(int n_layer_trunk) {
     // --host-experts mmap: no plan, every expert stays in the mapping (the cache registers what a GPU reads).
+    // The heat map is still opened here (the plan below opens it on its other paths), so the mmap tier's tables
+    // adopt the persisted prior at registration and the session's tallies are saved; without it the map was
+    // never read or written in mmap mode.  LLAMA_MMAP_HEAT_OPEN=0: the previous behaviour.
     if (mmap_host_experts) {
+        static const bool heat_open = [] {
+            const char * e = getenv("LLAMA_MMAP_HEAT_OPEN");
+            return e == nullptr || atoi(e) != 0;
+        }();
+        if (heat_open && !files.empty()) {
+            for (size_t i = 0; i < ggml_backend_dev_count(); i++) {
+                ggml_backend_dev_t d = ggml_backend_dev_get(i);
+                if (d != nullptr && ggml_backend_dev_type(d) != GGML_BACKEND_DEVICE_TYPE_CPU) {
+                    ggml_backend_dev_moe_heat_open(d, files.front()->path().c_str());
+                }
+            }
+        }
         return;
     }
     if (host_experts_plan_done) {
